\hdr{Verdict}
\vspace{-1pt}
\begin{tikzpicture}
\node[draw=crit,line width=1.2pt,fill=crit!8,rounded corners=3pt,
      inner sep=6pt,text width=\linewidth-14pt,align=left] {
  {\sffamily\bfseries\normalsize\color{crit} NO RELIABLE READ — do not act on this run.}\\[3pt]
  {\footnotesize Fit went non-physiological (rulebook \textbf{R1}, tube-law escape):
  resting jugular area \textbf{6.12\,cm\textsuperscript{2}} against a physiological
  0.8--2.0. The fit inflated the vein and blocked the collateral to manufacture the
  measured ICP step — neither is a statement about this patient.\\[3pt]
  \textbf{ACTION:} repeat the manoeuvre. The two venous components cannot be assessed.
  Findings below the artefact line are unaffected and may be read.}};
\end{tikzpicture}
\vspace{3pt}
