Intracranial compliance       & 0.63 & low  & 0.226 vs 0.50--1.10 mL/mmHg\\
Spinal dural sac              & 0.63 & low  & shares the same parameter\\
Cerebral arterial\rlap{$^{\dagger}$} & 0.39 & low & 0.0109 vs 0.015--0.05 mL/mmHg\\
